WEBVTT

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:40.010
Stay on your knees.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:42.050
He's being held on suspicion of murder.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:42.930
Murder?

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:52.590
And though a short exchange of weapons
fire occurred just a few minutes ago,

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:58.300
Police and S.W.A.T.Teamsmaintain position as we
enter the third hour of this intense stand-Off.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:02.650
Authorities estimate as many as 10
hostages are being held inside the bank.

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:05.540
No word as yet on the
identity of the suspects

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:08.880
Something's happening.

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:10.790
I think they're opening a door.

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.030
Roger, you getting this?

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:16.680
Over there.

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:20.510
Turn the camera over there.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:25.530
No, no, no, no, no!

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:26.440
Don't even think about it!

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:27.670
Get the hell back!

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.540
So, what's it like -Being an fbi guy?

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:49.570
Well...

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:51.100
It's dangerous.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:52.450
You know.

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:56.950
And the secrets we got to
keep -Oh, countless secrets.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:00.200
But mostly it's -It's lonely.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.710
I so know what you mean.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:04.000
Yeah.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:07.090
Helena was our head buyer.

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.200
She -She was family, you know?

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:13.950
She said it herself every
year at the christmas party.

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:15.820
She said we were the
only family she had.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.340
So there were never any signs
that she'd do something like this.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.150
No...

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:21.210
Still can't believe it, even now.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:26.830
That night, helena came back to the store after
closing, cleaned out all the display cases and the safe.

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:31.580
Edgar, our night watchman
-He caught her in the act.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:32.690
He didn't know what to do.

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:34.310
He'd known her for years.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.110
He called me at home.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.860
And that's when she took his gun?

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:42.190
She shot him in the face.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:47.440
I heard him die over the phone.

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:49.890
Any idea what her
motive could have been?

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:50.980
What motive?

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.220
It makes no sense.

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:57.080
Why steal all those diamonds, all that
jewelry and then, what, just dump it somewhere?

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.640
Just hide it and then go home.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.350
She killed herself?

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:06.140
The cop said she dropped the hair
dryer in the bath and fried herself.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:08.090
They should know, right?

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:09.680
Yeah.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.800
Well, thanks, frannie.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.040
I think that's all I need.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:14.930
Really?

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:21.330
I mean, 'cause i've got more, you
know, if you wanted to interview me...

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.850
Sometime in private?

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:26.700
Yeah.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.990
Yeah, I think that's a good idea.

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:30.490
You're a true patriot.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:31.110
You really are.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.840
Why don't you write your
number down there for me?

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:38.370
So you never saw the security-Camera
footage yourself, then.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.490
The police -They took
all the tapes first thing.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:42.690
Of course they did.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:49.480
This is it.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:51.980
Freaking cops.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.440
They were just doing their job.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:56.370
No, they're doing our job, only they
don't know it, so they suck at it.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:58.530
Talk to me about this bank.

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:02.310
Milwaukee national trust -It
was hit about a month ago.

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:03.560
Same M.O.As the jewelry store?

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:07.550
Yep, inside job, longtime employee,
the "never in a million years" type.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:11.450
Dude robs the bank, then goes home
and supposedly commits suicide.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.160
Resnick was the security guard on duty?

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:17.080
Yeah, he was actually beaten unconscious
by the teller who heisted the place.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:17.730
Oh, god.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:18.660
Yeah.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.400
Mr.Resnick!

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.370
Ronald resnick.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.190
Fbi, mr.Resnick.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.380
Let me see the badge.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.080
I already gave my
statement to the police.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:52.680
Listen, ronald, just some things about your
statement we wanted to get some clarification on.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.020
You read it?

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:54.980
Sure did.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.260
Come to listen to what I got to say?

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:57.500
That's why we're here.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.020
Well...

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.250
Come on in.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:11.070
See, none of the cops ever called me back,
not after I told them what was really going on.

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.500
They all thought I was crazy.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:17.580
First off, juan morales never
robbed the milwaukee national trust.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.090
That I guarantee.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:20.450
See, me and juan were friends.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:24.110
He used to come back to the bank on
my night shifts, and we'd play cards.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:29.420
So you let him into the
bank that night, after hours.

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.060
The thing I let into the bank...

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.590
Wasn't juan.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:37.820
I mean, it had his face,
but it wasn't his face.

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:41.790
Every detail was perfect, but too perfect,
you know, like if a doll maker made it,

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.330
Like I was talking to a big juan doll.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.840
A juan doll?

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:48.360
Look, this wasn't the
only time this happened.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:54.100
There was this jewelry store, too, and the
cops and you guys, you just won't see it.

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:57.200
Both crimes were pulled
by the same thing.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.320
And what's that, mr.Resnick?

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.560
Chinese been working on them for
years, and the russians before that

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:12.580
Part man, part machine, like the terminator, but the kind
that can change itself, make itself look like other people.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:13.490
Like the one from "t2."

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:14.280
Exactly!

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:18.880
So not just a robot,
more of a -A man-Droid.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:20.490
A man-Droid?

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:23.450
What makes you so sure
about this, ronald?

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.630
I made copies of all the security tapes.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.570
I knew once the cops got
them, they'd be buried.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:34.560
Here.

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:37.020
Now watch.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.350
WatcH.

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:42.160
Watch him.

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:42.970
Watch.Watch.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.900
See, look, there it is!

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:48.080
You see?

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.590
He's got the laser eyes.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:02.620
Cops said it was some kind of reflected
light, some kind of "camera flare."

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:03.660
Okay?

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.500
Ain't no damn camera flare.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.710
They say I'm a post-Trauma case.

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:08.670
So what?

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.060
Bank goes and fires me.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:10.990
It don't matter.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.540
The man-Droid is still out there.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:20.190
If the law won't hunt this
thing down, I'll do it myself.

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:24.600
You see, this thing, I-It kills the real
person, makes it look like a suicide,

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:29.990
Then it sort of like morphs into that person, cases
the job for a while till it knows the take is fat,

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.790
And then it finds its opening.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.620
Now, these robberies,
they're grouped together,

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:39.470
So I figure the man-Droid is holed up somewhere
in the middle -Underground maybe -I don't know.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:45.000
M-Maybe that's where it recharges
its m-Man-Droid batteries.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.020
Okay.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.620
I want you to listen very carefully.

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:54.400
'Cause I'm about to tell you the
god's honest truth about all of this.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:07:59.570
There's no such thing as man-Droids.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.220
There's nothing evil or
inhuman going on out there.

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:05.190
It's just people.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:05.950
Nothing else.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:06.860
You understand?

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.600
The laser eyes just a
camera flare, mr.Resnick.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:17.530
I know you don't want to believe this, but
your friend juan robbed the bank, and that's it.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.010
Get out of my house!

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:23.000
Now!

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:24.050
Sure.

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:25.460
First things first.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.520
Man, that has got to be
the kicker, straight up.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:37.380
When you told that poor son of a bitch to -What
did you say, "remand" the tapes that he copied?

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:40.290
"Classified evidence of
an ongoing investigation"?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.520
That's messed up.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.270
What are you, pissed at me?

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:47.290
No, I just think it's a little
creepy how good of a fed you are.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.430
We could have thrown the guy a bone.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:50.900
He did some good legwork here.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:52.890
"Man-Droid"?

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:54.890
Except for the man-Droid part.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:56.320
I liked him.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.730
He's not that different from you and me.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:58.550
People think we're crazy.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.780
Except he's not a hunter.

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:02.450
He's just a guy who
stumbled onto something real.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.980
If he were to go up against
this thing, he'd get torn apart.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.740
Better to stay in the
dark and stay alive.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:08.780
Yeah, I guess.

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:12.680
Shapeshifter.

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:15.890
Just like back in st.Louis.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.700
Same retinal reaction to video.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:19.610
Eyes flare at the camera.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.700
I hate those freaking things.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.060
You think I don't?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.230
One didn't turn into you
and frame you for murder.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:32.610
Well, look, if this shifter's anything like the
one we killed in missouri then ronald's right.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.970
All right, they like to lair up
underground, preferably the sewer.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.900
All the robberies have been
connected so far, right?

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:44.650
Through the, uh, sewer main layout.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:50.830
There's one more bank lined
up on that same sewer main.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:02.560
Well, we haven't had any
flags go up on our system yet.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.750
No, no, this is a glitch
in the overall grid.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.950
Just want to make sure the
branch monitors are kosher.

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.770
Better to be safe than sorry, I guess.

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:09.580
That's the plan.

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:14.450
All righty.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:16.120
You guys need anything else?

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:16.780
Oh, no, no, no.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:18.270
We'll be in and out.

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:19.360
Just a routine check.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.470
Okeydokey.

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:24.280
I like him.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:25.490
He says "okeydokey."

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:26.620
What if he's the shifter?

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:31.100
Well, then we follow him home, put a
silver bullet through his chest plate.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:37.300
Okay.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:38.820
You got any popcorn?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.770
Looks like mr.Okeydokey'S...

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.250
Okeydokey.

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:56.880
Maybe we jumped the gun on this, dean.

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:00.040
We don't even know it's here.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.130
Maybe we should just
go to the sewers and...

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:04.960
And...

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.400
And...

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.700
Dean, we're supposed
to be looking for eyes.

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:13.930
I'm getting there.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.390
Oh, yeah?

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:16.420
Yeah.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:19.850
Wait a minute.

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:23.940
Hello, freak.

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:24.940
Got him.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:27.930
Sam.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.290
What?

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:36.450
Hello, ronald.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.280
This is not a robbery!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:56.940
Everybody on the floor now!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.040
Get down, damn it!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.260
Come on!

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:04.810
On the floor, on the floor.

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.260
In the middle!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.080
On the floor in the middle.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.020
In middle, on the floor, come on!

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:10.730
Hurry up!

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:11.630
Come on!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.140
And you said we shouldn't bring guns.

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:17.820
I didn't know this
was gonna happen, dean.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:18.700
Let me do the talking.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:20.510
I don't think he likes
you, agent johnson.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:27.600
There's only one way in or out of here, and I
chained it up, so nobody's leaving, you understand?

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:28.640
Hey, buddy.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:30.730
Why don't you calm down?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:31.890
Just calm down.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.370
What?

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:35.460
You!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:38.010
Get on the floor now!

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:39.050
Okay, we're doing that.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.290
Just don't shoot anybody, especially us.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.180
I knew it -As soon as you two left.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:44.230
You ain't fbi.

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:45.310
Who are you?

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.610
Who are you working for, huh?

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:48.770
The men in black?

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:51.380
You working for the man-Droid?

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:52.520
We're not!

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:54.000
You shut up!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.050
I ain't talking to you!

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:56.440
I don't like you!

00:12:58.060 --> 00:12:58.730
Fair enough.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:03.800
Get over there.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.630
Frisk them down, make
sure they got no weapons.

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:06.560
Go!

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:23.910
And what have we here?

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.600
I'm not just gonna walk in here naked.

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:29.000
Give that there.

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:31.680
No, no, no, no.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:37.460
We know you don't want to hurt anybody.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.510
But that's what's gonna happen
if you keep waving that cannon.

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:40.830
Why don't you let these people go?

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:41.680
No!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:42.820
I already told you.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.850
If nobody's gonna stop this thing,
then I've got to do it myself!

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:47.120
We believe you!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:47.900
That's why we're here.

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:49.150
You don't believe me!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.580
Nobody believes me!

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:53.780
How could they?

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:57.390
Come here.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:13:59.640
What?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:00.730
No.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:01.690
You're holding the gun, boss.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:02.440
You're calling the shots.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.820
I just want to tell
you something.Come here.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.100
It's the bank manager.

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:15.690
What?

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.980
Why do you think we
got these getups, huh?

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:21.100
We've been monitoring
the cameras in the back.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.610
We saw the bank manager.

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:24.020
We saw his eyes.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.140
His laser eyes?

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:26.900
Yes.

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:27.350
No.

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:27.710
No!

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:28.740
We're running out of time.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:30.710
We got to find him before
he changes into someone else.

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:31.690
Like I'm gonna listen to you.

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.310
You're a damn liar.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.030
I'll shoot you!

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:37.070
Get down!

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.140
Take me.

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:41.670
Take me as a hostage.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:45.930
But we got to act fast because the longer we
just sit here, the more time he has to change.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.420
Look at me, man.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.210
I believe you.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.250
You're not crazy.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.850
There really is something
inside this bank.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.040
All right.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.260
Y-You come with me.

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:10.230
But everyone else gets in the vault!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:27.470
Come on, move!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.320
Move, move!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.580
Then you lock it up.

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:41.630
It's okay, everyone.

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:42.490
Just stay cool.

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:47.400
Now spin that.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.260
Spin that there.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.340
Who is that man?

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:56.520
He's my brother.

00:15:58.110 --> 00:16:00.920
He is so brave.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:08.520
Check behind the desk.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:28.560
What the hell is that?

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:36.620
Oh, great.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:40.020
When it changes form,
it sheds its old skin.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.460
So now it could be anybody.

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:44.420
So...

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.090
So weird.

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:50.350
Its robot skin is so lifelike.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.390
Okay, let's get something straight.

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:52.730
It's not a man-Droid.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:54.210
It's a shapeshifter.

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:54.820
Shapeshifter?

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:55.680
Yeah.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.620
It's human, more or less.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.050
It has human drive.

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.420
And in this case, it's money.

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.710
But it generates its own skin.

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.330
It can shape it to match
someone else's features

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:07.770
So I-It kills someone and
then takes their place.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.500
Kills them -I don't think it matters.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.500
What are you doing?

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:16.080
Nice.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.100
You remember the old werewolf stories?

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.390
Pretty much came from these guys.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.730
Silver's the only thing
I've seen that hurts them.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:25.620
Come on, ronald.

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:34.010
How we doing?

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.690
Another day in paradise.

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:37.130
No one's come out yet?

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:38.770
This guy locked himself in.

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:41.830
First thing he did.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:45.710
All right.

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:48.000
Cut the power.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:50.630
What are you, nuts?

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:51.810
That's just it.

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:54.180
I'm not nuts.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:59.120
I mean, I was so scared that I was
losing my marbles, but this is real.

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:01.330
I mean, I-I was right.

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.910
Except for the man-Droid thing.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:04.690
Thank you.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:06.550
Yeah, don't mention it.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:14.770
Damn it.

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:17.080
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:18.080
What is it?

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:18.770
They cut the power.

00:19:18.770 --> 00:19:20.220
It's probably their way of saying hi.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.070
Who?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:22.070
Cops.

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:23.170
The cops?

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.940
You weren't exactly a smooth
criminal about this, ron.

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:28.050
You didn't even secure
the security guard.

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:29.030
He probably called them.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:30.860
Well, I didn't think to hang on.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:31.850
Let's just take a breath for a second.

00:19:33.890 --> 00:19:35.220
They probably got us surrounded.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:39.370
They cut the power to the cameras, so there's
no way of telling who the shapeshifter is.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.510
It's not looking good, ron.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:48.670
Did you hear that?

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:51.700
Has your brother always been so...

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:53.630
Wonderful?

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.960
I mean, staring down that gun.

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:02.540
And the way he played right into that psycho's
crazy head, telling him what he wanted to hear?

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:07.590
Hero or something.

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:08.600
Yeah.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:09.910
Yeah.

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.770
Oh, my g-You saved us!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.130
You saved us!

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:16.720
Actually I just found a few more.

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:18.970
Come on, everybody, let's go.

00:20:18.970 --> 00:20:19.840
Let's go.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:29.670
What are you doing?

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.080
Sam, look, ronald and
i need to talk to you.

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:45.970
It shed its skin again.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:46.920
We don't know when.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.530
Could be in the halls, the vault.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:50.700
Great.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:53.450
You know, dean, you are
wanted by the police.

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:54.360
Yeah.

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:57.760
So even if we do find this damn thing,
how the hell are we gonna get out of here?

00:20:57.760 --> 00:20:59.350
One problem at a time.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:02.710
I'm gonna do a sweep of the whole
place, see if I can find any stragglers.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:05.480
Once we get everyone together,
we got to play "find the freak."

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:06.610
So here.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:08.130
I found another one of these for you.

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:09.150
Now, stay here.

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:10.850
Make sure ronald doesn't hurt anybody.

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:13.360
Help him manage the help him manage?

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.090
Are you insane?

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:21.160
Look, I know this isn't
going the way we wanted.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:21.990
Understatement.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:27.000
But if we invite the cops in right now, ronald gets
arrested, we get arrested, the shifter gets away.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:31.820
Probably never find
it again, okay -Ron!

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:33.800
Out of the light!

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:39.420
Seriously?

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:40.840
Ron's plan was a bad plan.

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:44.670
It was a bit of a crazy plan, but right
now, crazy's the only game in town, okay?

00:21:58.600 --> 00:21:59.710
Hi, ronald.

00:22:59.570 --> 00:23:02.600
I'm gonna keep this open, get you folks
some fresh air in there, all right?

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:05.240
But no one leaves this vault.

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:09.340
I don't understand.

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:10.880
Why are you helping him?

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:12.800
You wouldn't believe me if I told you.

00:23:14.850 --> 00:23:15.720
H-Hello?

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:17.040
I think I got to get out of here.

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:19.200
Sir, I'm very sorry, but you're
just gonna have to stay put.

00:23:19.200 --> 00:23:22.360
What do you mean, demands?

00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:23.390
Ronald...

00:23:23.390 --> 00:23:24.160
Hang up.

00:23:24.160 --> 00:23:25.700
I-I'm not a bank robber.

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:27.360
I got to really get out of here.

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:28.350
Sir, you can't leave.

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:30.400
Kind of a crime fighter, I guess.

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:31.530
Ronald!

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:35.820
Look...

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:37.470
No, I'm acting alone.

00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:40.040
Ronald...

00:23:41.050 --> 00:23:42.320
The less the cops know, the better.

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:44.190
I think this dude's
having a heart attack!

00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:45.590
Great.

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:47.250
Could be our guy, could be a trick.

00:23:47.250 --> 00:23:48.410
Are you just gonna let the man die?

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:49.740
No one's dying in here!

00:23:50.140 --> 00:23:50.990
Cover the door.

00:23:58.470 --> 00:24:00.450
Can you tell me how many
hostages this guy's taken?

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:02.650
One of the people in here
could be having heart trouble.

00:24:02.650 --> 00:24:04.020
You need to send in a paramedic.

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:05.600
Just stay calm, sir.

00:24:05.600 --> 00:24:07.280
Just send in a paramedic, okay?!

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:08.700
Don't try anything else!

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:09.990
Please.

00:24:10.030 --> 00:24:10.860
Paramedic?

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:12.130
Guy don't have time for that, man.

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:14.460
Listen, I-I'm sorry, okay?

00:24:14.460 --> 00:24:15.560
But nobody's getting out.

00:24:15.560 --> 00:24:16.940
He's dying right in front of you.

00:24:18.170 --> 00:24:19.000
Help.

00:24:57.910 --> 00:24:58.400
Come on, man.

00:24:58.400 --> 00:24:59.740
You got to unlock the front door.

00:25:00.470 --> 00:25:01.560
We got to get him out of here.

00:25:02.270 --> 00:25:04.170
Both of you stay where you are!

00:25:11.320 --> 00:25:12.250
You know what, ronald?

00:25:13.050 --> 00:25:13.740
He's right.

00:25:14.030 --> 00:25:15.410
We got to get this man outside.

00:25:15.410 --> 00:25:15.930
Come on.

00:25:15.930 --> 00:25:16.760
I got you.

00:25:17.410 --> 00:25:18.370
I'll help you.

00:25:18.370 --> 00:25:19.010
Oh, I got him.

00:25:19.010 --> 00:25:20.130
It's cool.

00:25:20.130 --> 00:25:21.090
Thanks.

00:25:22.660 --> 00:25:23.260
Watch your step.

00:25:23.260 --> 00:25:23.720
Thank you.

00:25:23.720 --> 00:25:24.240
Sure.

00:25:24.240 --> 00:25:25.010
Thank you.

00:25:30.620 --> 00:25:32.010
Let's go up these steps.

00:25:37.220 --> 00:25:38.420
Hey, can I talk to you for a second?

00:25:41.090 --> 00:25:42.150
You have the gun, man.

00:25:43.610 --> 00:25:44.300
Whatever.

00:25:50.420 --> 00:25:50.930
Stop!

00:25:50.930 --> 00:25:52.380
Come back here!

00:26:45.680 --> 00:26:46.300
Here.

00:26:49.160 --> 00:26:50.130
Take care of the guard.

00:26:50.770 --> 00:26:51.920
I'm going after the shifter.

00:27:08.040 --> 00:27:08.970
Sorry, ron.

00:27:09.850 --> 00:27:11.340
You did a real good
job tracking this thing.

00:27:11.340 --> 00:27:12.230
You really did.

00:27:44.380 --> 00:27:46.120
Oh, god, please don't hurt us.

00:27:46.120 --> 00:27:47.730
You shouldn't be back here right now!

00:27:47.730 --> 00:27:48.480
You're in danger!

00:27:48.480 --> 00:27:50.410
Now go back to the vault, now.

00:28:03.990 --> 00:28:06.020
Don't shoot! Don't shoot! Please!

00:28:06.440 --> 00:28:07.160
No, no, no, no!

00:28:07.160 --> 00:28:08.160
Back up!

00:28:08.480 --> 00:28:09.590
Don't even think about it!

00:28:09.990 --> 00:28:12.080
Please, don't shoot!

00:28:17.160 --> 00:28:18.610
I said get back now!

00:28:20.030 --> 00:28:21.410
One of the hostages seems to
have taken over the situation.

00:28:21.410 --> 00:28:22.800
Excuse me?

00:28:23.610 --> 00:28:25.240
Go, go, go.

00:28:34.030 --> 00:28:35.100
We are so screwed.

00:28:42.860 --> 00:28:43.640
Yeah?

00:28:43.640 --> 00:28:44.830
Slipped his skin.

00:28:44.830 --> 00:28:45.560
What?

00:28:45.560 --> 00:28:48.960
Yeah, bastard shifts fast, a lot
faster than the one in st.Louis.

00:28:48.960 --> 00:28:50.650
It's like playing a shell game.

00:28:50.650 --> 00:28:51.910
It could be anybody again.

00:28:52.180 --> 00:28:53.960
I think most of the
employees are in the vault.

00:28:53.960 --> 00:28:55.400
You search every inch of this place.

00:28:55.400 --> 00:28:56.850
I'm gonna go round everybody up.

00:29:12.430 --> 00:29:13.170
Crap.

00:29:13.170 --> 00:29:14.060
What?

00:29:14.060 --> 00:29:15.450
The feds are here.

00:29:16.490 --> 00:29:17.870
Oh, crap.

00:29:23.670 --> 00:29:24.670
Lieutenant robards.

00:29:25.440 --> 00:29:26.070
Yeah.

00:29:26.460 --> 00:29:27.910
Special agent hendrickson.

00:29:27.910 --> 00:29:29.030
Let me guess.

00:29:29.030 --> 00:29:32.390
You're lead dog now, but you would
just love my full cooperation.

00:29:32.390 --> 00:29:33.820
I don't give a rat's ass what you do.

00:29:33.820 --> 00:29:36.070
You can go get a doughnut and
bang your wife for all I care.

00:29:36.070 --> 00:29:38.750
What I do need is your
S.W.A.T.Team locked and loaded.

00:29:40.170 --> 00:29:43.610
Listen, agent, something's
not right about this.

00:29:44.410 --> 00:29:45.150
It's, uh...

00:29:46.410 --> 00:29:48.340
It's not going down like a usual heist.

00:29:48.340 --> 00:29:49.830
That's because it isn't one.

00:29:50.310 --> 00:29:52.570
You have no idea what
you're dealing with, do you?

00:29:53.230 --> 00:29:55.680
There is a monster
in that bank, robards.

00:30:21.220 --> 00:30:23.310
And I thought you were
one of the good guys.

00:30:25.210 --> 00:30:25.940
What's your name?

00:30:26.250 --> 00:30:27.290
Why would you care?

00:30:27.660 --> 00:30:28.450
My name's dean.

00:30:30.680 --> 00:30:31.280
I'm sheri.

00:30:32.470 --> 00:30:33.270
Hi, sheri.

00:30:37.450 --> 00:30:38.690
Everything's gonna be all right.

00:30:38.900 --> 00:30:40.500
This will all be over soon, okay?

00:30:53.170 --> 00:30:53.780
Yeah.

00:30:53.930 --> 00:30:55.680
This is special agent
victor hendrickson.

00:30:55.680 --> 00:30:58.060
I'm not really in a negotiating mood.

00:30:58.060 --> 00:30:59.190
Good.Me neither.

00:30:59.190 --> 00:31:01.990
It's my job to bring you in
-Alive's a bonus, but not necessary.

00:31:01.990 --> 00:31:04.300
That's harsh for a federal
agent, don't you think?

00:31:04.300 --> 00:31:06.320
Well, you're not the typical
suspect, are you, dean?

00:31:08.540 --> 00:31:11.850
I want you and sam out
here unarmed, or we come in.

00:31:11.850 --> 00:31:14.380
And, yes, I know about
sam -Bonnie to your clyde.

00:31:15.020 --> 00:31:17.650
Yeah, well, that part's true, but
how'd you even know we were here?

00:31:17.650 --> 00:31:18.510
Go screw yourself.

00:31:18.510 --> 00:31:19.560
That's how I knew.

00:31:19.560 --> 00:31:21.780
It's become my job to
know about you, dean.

00:31:21.780 --> 00:31:23.730
I've been looking for you for weeks now.

00:31:23.730 --> 00:31:27.200
I know about the murder in st.Louis,
the houdini act you pulled in baltimore.

00:31:27.200 --> 00:31:29.610
I know about the
desecrations and the thefts.

00:31:29.610 --> 00:31:30.900
I know about your dad.

00:31:30.900 --> 00:31:33.020
You don't know crap about my dad.

00:31:33.020 --> 00:31:39.290
Ex-Marine, raised his kids on the road, cheap motels,
backwood cabins -Real paramilitary survivalist type.

00:31:39.290 --> 00:31:44.680
I just can't get a handle on what type of wacko he
was -White supremist, timmy mcveigh, tomato, tomahto.

00:31:44.680 --> 00:31:47.110
You got no right talking
about my dad like that.

00:31:47.660 --> 00:31:48.800
He was a hero.

00:31:48.910 --> 00:31:50.030
Yeah, right.

00:31:50.030 --> 00:31:51.170
Sure sounds like it.

00:31:51.170 --> 00:31:54.980
You have one hour to make a decision, or
we come through those doors full automatic.

00:32:01.540 --> 00:32:02.230
Scramble your men.

00:32:02.230 --> 00:32:03.570
Five minutes, then we go in.

00:32:03.570 --> 00:32:04.450
What?

00:32:04.450 --> 00:32:07.090
Hendrickson, they've let
out one hostage so far.

00:32:07.090 --> 00:32:08.430
They've hurt no one
as far as we can tell.

00:32:08.430 --> 00:32:09.950
You don't know these winchesters.

00:32:09.950 --> 00:32:11.620
They're dangerous and expertly trained.

00:32:11.620 --> 00:32:13.590
We can't risk the lives
of all those people.

00:32:13.590 --> 00:32:15.530
Dean's a greater risk
to them than we are.

00:32:15.530 --> 00:32:16.360
This is crazy.

00:32:16.360 --> 00:32:19.140
Crazy's in there, and
I just hung up on it.

00:32:56.870 --> 00:32:58.010
Amn it.

00:33:01.760 --> 00:33:03.300
We got a bit of a problem outside.

00:33:04.810 --> 00:33:05.940
We got a problem in here.

00:33:09.590 --> 00:33:10.440
Sheri?

00:33:11.270 --> 00:33:12.140
We're gonna let you go.

00:33:12.660 --> 00:33:13.440
What?

00:33:14.500 --> 00:33:15.340
Why me?

00:33:15.600 --> 00:33:17.360
As a show of good faith
to the feds.Come on.

00:33:21.660 --> 00:33:24.430
I think I'd rather stay
here with the others.

00:33:25.410 --> 00:33:26.660
I'm afraid I'm gonna have to insist.

00:33:49.510 --> 00:33:50.600
I thought you were letting me go.

00:33:52.620 --> 00:33:54.440
Oh, god!

00:33:57.010 --> 00:33:59.420
Was that community theater, or
are you just naturally that good?

00:33:59.420 --> 00:34:01.880
This is the last time
you become anybody, ever.

00:34:02.400 --> 00:34:03.240
God

00:34:26.830 --> 00:34:27.980
Dean, wait, wait, wait.

00:34:29.950 --> 00:34:31.220
What's the advantage of this plan?

00:34:33.110 --> 00:34:35.080
I mean, fainting now
wouldn't help it survive.

00:34:42.140 --> 00:34:42.990
No!

00:35:15.530 --> 00:35:16.820
Get her out of here now!

00:36:15.780 --> 00:36:16.580
Don't shoot!

00:36:17.690 --> 00:36:18.700
Don't shoot!

00:36:19.500 --> 00:36:20.040
I work here.

00:36:20.440 --> 00:36:21.150
I work here.

00:37:24.570 --> 00:37:25.690
Gross.

00:38:22.400 --> 00:38:22.930
Move!

00:38:22.930 --> 00:38:23.460
Clear!

00:38:23.460 --> 00:38:24.330
Move!

00:38:25.510 --> 00:38:26.330
Clear.

00:38:26.710 --> 00:38:27.690
Move.

00:38:28.080 --> 00:38:28.780
Clear.

00:38:33.480 --> 00:38:36.060
Male, african-American, goner.

00:38:37.790 --> 00:38:41.230
Telling you, man, I just
walked her out of the bank.

00:38:42.380 --> 00:38:44.650
She must have a twin
sister or something.

00:39:00.050 --> 00:39:01.820
Sir, my team said it's secure.

00:39:01.820 --> 00:39:02.440
They're gone.

00:39:02.440 --> 00:39:06.040
You tell your team to tear it apart
-The ducts, the ceilings, everything.

